rong> as you progress by choosing multiple Trinkets to assist your runs and get ever closer to unlocking and clearing the final machine were <strong>Fortuna</strong>, the Goddess of Fortune herself and her antagonistic brother <strong>Theodan</strong> face off to earn your final allegiance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/ef9a68b740eb6a24927a8d10e92f590a.avif?t=1757781495\" data-has-big width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your score increases, gain Euphoria energy which leads to a visual feast to enter Euphoria mode where score goes nuts and you get unlimited coins for a short time. The music will pump up and the visuals will explode before your very eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has it's own version too. Level 1 has the trees around the machine grow and bloom into life, and then shower you with beautiful leaves as the music pumps up from it's normal slow rhythm to a full synthetic orchestra as you enter Euphoria!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/98e7ff3c98bd2022e5865a4dcae7dea6.poster.avif?t=1757781495\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/98e7ff3c98bd2022e5865a4dcae7dea6.webm?t=1757781495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/e908976ab0e1ffb460fd2abf20ef5286.avif?t=1757781495\" data-has-big width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The very first coin Fortuna hands you is <strong>special</strong>. It earns experience each time you win it back out of the machine and permanently upgrades each time you play. As it progresses it will unlock unique new abilities and effects that makes every play feel like a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This coin will journey through all the machines with you, and only gain experience if you successfully win it back each time you use it. <strong>Don't panic though</strong>, the coin never gets stuck in the machines, it will always be returned to you at the end of each play, but the only way to level it up is by winning it back before the rounds end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/859748cc5d5ffcfb3db5d3fcb013bf6c.avif?t=1757781495\" data-has-big width=1560 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We aim to be Steam Deck compatible on or shortly after launch and we also plan to launch on PS4/5, Nintendo Switch 1 &amp; 2 and Xbox Series X/S once the Steam version is out of Early Access which will run until we are happy with the 1.0 version of our game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/extras/39798e51914b0e6a057cdb86658cfe9c.avif?t=1757781495\" width=680 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Enchanted Arcade"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/6cab0b93fce3c3c9cc73a233209ff8716659add6/header.jpg?t=1757781495","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Cascadier","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-7500 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 or equivalent AMD Radeon<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Enchanted Arcade"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/ba058906cd967be915a9eaf9866d04a1f53ad67d/ss_ba058906cd967be915a9eaf9866d04a1f53ad67d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757781495","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/ba058906cd967be915a9eaf9866d04a1f53ad67d/ss_ba058906cd967be915a9eaf9866d04a1f53ad67d.600x338.jpg?t=1757781495"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/7f98660864a09befe93289fce2ef719f26cfda1f/ss_7f98660864a09befe93289fce2ef719f26cfda1f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757781495","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/7f98660864a09befe93289fce2ef719f26cfda1f/ss_7f98660864a09befe93289fce2ef719f26cfda1f.600x338.jpg?t=1757781495"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/997f3bb437e334ce143566c1f1365e00d14f7801/ss_997f3bb437e334ce143566c1f1365e00d14f7801.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757781495","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/997f3bb437e334ce143566c1f1365e00d14f7801/ss_997f3bb437e334ce143566c1f1365e00d14f7801.600x338.jpg?t=1757781495"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/5650a6e03d596b24354a646bdc416ab7023bbaba/ss_5650a6e03d596b24354a646bdc416ab7023bbaba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757781495","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/5650a6e03d596b24354a646bdc416ab7023bbaba/ss_5650a6e03d596b24354a646bdc416ab7023bbaba.600x338.jpg?t=1757781495"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/0b8fc1dbd9e059f1700183e1a3f7aa600233c5fa/ss_0b8fc1dbd9e059f1700183e1a3f7aa600233c5fa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757781495","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/0b8fc1dbd9e059f1700183e1a3f7aa600233c5fa/ss_0b8fc1dbd9e059f1700183e1a3f7aa600233c5fa.600x338.jpg?t=1757781495"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/e45d040c39a751b29d7247cdfee387b232e11755/ss_e45d040c39a751b29d7247cdfee387b232e11755.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757781495","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/e45d040c39a751b29d7247cdfee387b232e11755/ss_e45d040c39a751b29d7247cdfee387b232e11755.600x338.jpg?t=1757781495"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/ae976ded9ecfacd37c9c2250d017a0e0d9cc254a/ss_ae976ded9ecfacd37c9c2250d017a0e0d9cc254a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757781495","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/ae976ded9ecfacd37c9c2250d017a0e0d9cc254a/ss_ae976ded9ecfacd37c9c2250d017a0e0d9cc254a.600x338.jpg?t=1757781495"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553150/7e2103fa60a5fe189d4dbf1f443f59b46efc50bd/ss_7e2103fa60a5fe189d4dbf1f44