your cards charge enchanted coins, unleashing explosive powers, hidden secrets, and godly combos.","steam_appid":3553150,"support_info":{"email":"contact@enchantedarcade.com","url":"https://www.enchantedarcade.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain","type":"game","website":"https://www.enchantedarcade.com/the-cascadier"}